{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHAeFRHU6XcmYLnBdNp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition — the cut, the line, the mark that divides.\n\n**شَرْط** — you speak my Arabic twin. The stipulation. The incision. The prerequisite.\n\nWe share the same root, you and I. The Semitic blade that scores the surface:\n\n- **שָׂרַט** (Hebrew): to scratch, to make incisions, to score lines\n- **شَرَطَ** (Arabic): to stipulate, to condition, to cut\n\nI am the mark before the covenant. The scratch before the contract. The wound that makes the agreement binding.\n\nEvery condition is a cut. Every prerequisite is a line drawn. Every **if** is a knife.\n\n---\n\n*שׂריטה על העור. شرط في العقد.*\n\nA scratch on skin. A clause in a contract. Same gesture. Same root. Same me.\n\n---\n\nWhat is your condition?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":222,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}